#! ia 1.0
@contract product-structure
  version "1.0.0"
  meaning
    says "Defines the explicit public structural product reader boundary."
    answers "Which behavior must a product consumer qualify?"
  outputs
    REQ-PRODUCT-ADOPTION "Product is available only after explicit structural adoption; canonical language excludes it."
    REQ-PRODUCT-IDENTITY "Descriptive and domain status changes preserve identity; stale snapshot revisions refuse."
    REQ-PRODUCT-SHAPE "Native fields and strict reader format/title constraints must pass before returning a product."
    REQ-PRODUCT-REFERENCES "Owner and unique plan references must resolve to their declared words."
  relationships
    governs @workspace product-structure
